# Test-Only Rule

When making changes to tests, DO NOT modify the following service files:
- app/lib/services/blockchain/rating_service.dart
- app/lib/services/blockchain/staking_service.dart
- app/lib/services/blockchain/wallet_service.dart

Only update the corresponding test files:
- app/test/services/blockchain/rating_service_test.dart
- app/test/services/blockchain/staking_service_test.dart
- app/test/services/blockchain/wallet_service_test.dart

This rule ensures that service implementations remain stable while tests are being developed or modified.
